{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-06_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-06","title":"握緊扶手","storyCode":"2-6","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-06_end.txt","sourceHash":"1ab7ef89c6503c0e15be4d5b181da8a3184d3516c02bf46037f60013161406af","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"突破了整合運動之後，羅德島一行完成了轉移。\n然而似乎是無法適應此前高強度的移動，米莎的身體狀況出現了問題。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十八关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"......說好讓我表現一下的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"你太慢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都平安無事就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們該轉移了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"從東邊這座建築物向下逐層移動吧，整合運動不會知道我們在哪裡的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們......安全了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是的......暫時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......你臉色不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......有一點頭暈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"沒......什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你來龍門......多長時間了，米莎小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"一個星期......吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"一個星期......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......城市裡......出現了很多怪人......然後就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道發生了什麼......大家都開始跑......我也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是整合運動......整合運動攻擊了切爾諾伯格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你......之前是感染者嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"但就是那幾天，腿上......長出了這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......米莎？米莎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"醫療！醫療小隊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["米莎"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克薩斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]}]}
